From 9e04138c234faeb1536d60d6445cc5b32e3cb3e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lezcano <lezcano-93@hotmail.com>
Date: Mon, 3 Nov 2025 14:21:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] [BACKEND] Initial support for 2CTA mode in Gluon

To do this, we allow dispatching to 2CTA mode automatically in gluon by
looking at the layouts. In the near future we will tighten more the
op verifier so that the user gets a nice error message if they provide a
pair of layouts that is not compatible with regular mma or 2CTA

We also fix the layout for M=64 2CTA mode which was previously wrong.

In a follow-up, we will enable 2CTA mode to be launched with an
arbitrary number of CTAs.
